# ============================================================
# Oracle deck → mandalacodes.com (the deck moved domains).
# Each old URL gets a proper 301 so search engines, printed QR
# codes, and any external backlinks land on the matching page
# on the new home. These rules must be BEFORE the SPA catch-all.
# /oracle (the small directory hub on this site) is NOT redirected.
# ============================================================
/oracle/universal-language/*   https://mandalacodes.com/oracle/universal-language/:splat  301
/oracle/universal-language     https://mandalacodes.com/oracle/universal-language          301
/oracle/the-systems            https://mandalacodes.com/oracle/universal-language          301
/oracle/profile                https://mandalacodes.com/oracle/universal-language          301

# Legacy back-compat oracle URLs (pre-rename) — same target.
/universal-language/*                            https://mandalacodes.com/oracle/universal-language/:splat  301
/universal-language                              https://mandalacodes.com/oracle/universal-language          301
/creations/oracle-cards/universal-language/*     https://mandalacodes.com/oracle/universal-language/:splat  301
/creations/oracle-cards/universal-language       https://mandalacodes.com/oracle/universal-language          301
/creations/oracle-cards                          https://mandalacodes.com/oracle/universal-language          301

